## Response Formats

### TTS Generation Response

```json
{
  "success": true,
  "prompt_id": "abc123def456",
  "message": "TTS generation started: Hello, how are you today?...",
  "status": "queued",
  "tts_urls": [],
  "note": "Check status with get_tts_status_simple(prompt_id)"
}
```

### TTS Status Response

```json
{
  "success": true,
  "status": "completed",
  "message": "TTS generation completed",
  "tts_urls": [
    "http://localhost:8188/view?filename=ComfyUI_20240731_123456.wav&type=output"
  ],
  "total_audio": 1
}
```

### Error Response

```json
{
  "success": false,
  "error": "TTS generation failed",
  "details": "ComfyUI is not running",
  "tts_urls": []
}
```

### Status Types

- `"queued"`: TTS generation has been queued
- `"running"`: TTS generation is currently running
- `"pending"`: TTS generation is waiting in queue
- `"completed"`: TTS generation completed successfully
- `"completed_error"`: TTS completed but failed to get URLs
- `"timeout"`: TTS generation timed out
- `"unknown"`: Prompt not found in history or queue

